---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const faq = [
  ['What is the best villa in Tuscany for families?', 'Borgo Pignano is one of my favorites. Around nine private villas, from two to five bedrooms, sit across a hilltop estate outside Volterra, so a family gets its own house with a full Relais &amp; Ch&acirc;teaux hotel behind it: two pools plus a separate kids&rsquo; pool, tennis, a gym and a spa.'],
  ['How many villas does Borgo Pignano have?', 'Around nine private villas spread across the estate, from two to five bedrooms. They vary in layout, privacy and view, so tell me who&rsquo;s coming and I&rsquo;ll match you to the right one.'],
  ['Is Borgo Pignano good for kids?', 'Yes. Beyond the villas themselves, there are two pools plus a separate kids&rsquo; pool, a tennis court and plenty of room to roam. It&rsquo;s a quiet country estate, so it suits families who want space and a slower pace.'],
  ['Do you get hotel service in the villas?', 'Yes. You have your own house, with hotel service and every amenity a short walk away: the pools, the spa, the gym, tennis and dinner under the pergola.'],
  ['Where is Borgo Pignano?', 'On a hilltop outside Volterra, about an hour and a half from Florence. It&rsquo;s a bit remote, so you&rsquo;ll want a car or a driver. Volterra and San Gimignano are within easy reach, and I arrange drivers who know the back roads.'],
  ['How long should we stay?', 'At least two or three nights, so the pool, the dinners and the drives out don&rsquo;t compete. Villa stays usually work best as the longer, slower part of an Italy trip.'],
  ['Can we combine it with Florence?', 'Yes. Borgo Pignano also runs a <a href="/hotels/borgo-pignano-florence.html">Florence address</a>, five minutes from the center. I&rsquo;ve stayed at both and can pair the city with the countryside in one trip.'],
  ['How much do the villas cost?', 'Rates depend on the villa, the season and the length of stay, so ask me for your dates and group size and I&rsquo;ll come back with the right options.'],
];

const kv = [
  ['Villas', '<b>Around 9</b>, from 2 to 5 bedrooms'],
  ['On the estate', 'Two pools plus a separate kids&rsquo; pool, tennis, a gym and a spa'],
  ['Dining', 'Dinner under the reed-roofed pergola, facing the valley'],
  ['Where', 'A hilltop outside Volterra, about 1.5 hours from Florence'],
  ['Collection', 'Relais &amp; Ch&acirc;teaux, part of Fora Reserve'],
];
---
<Layout
  canonical="borgo-pignano-villas-tuscany.html"
  title="Borgo Pignano Villas: The Best Family Villas in Tuscany | Suites With Keith"
  description="Keith's firsthand guide to the private villas at Borgo Pignano outside Volterra: around nine villas from two to five bedrooms, with hotel service, two pools plus a kids' pool, tennis, a gym and a spa. One of the best family villa stays in Tuscany."
  preload="/images/tuscany/borgo-pignano-pool-wide.jpg"
  ctaLabel="Ask about the villas"
>

<script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faq.map(([q, a]) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: q.replace(/&rsquo;/g, '’'), acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').replace(/&rsquo;/g, '’').replace(/&amp;/g, '&').replace(/&acirc;/g, 'â') } })),
})} />

<header class="hero" style="min-height:min(78svh,720px);">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/images/tuscany/borgo-pignano-pool-wide.jpg" alt="The Borgo Pignano pool cut into the hillside above the Tuscan valley outside Volterra" width="1600" height="760" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Tuscany &middot; Stayed at Borgo Pignano</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl" style="margin-top:18px;">The Villas at Borgo Pignano</h1>
    <p class="sub">One of the best family villa stays in Tuscany: around nine private villas on a hilltop outside Volterra, with a full Relais &amp; Ch&acirc;teaux hotel behind them.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#inquire" data-gtag-label="start_planning" data-gtag-location="hero">Ask about the villas</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-shadow" href="/hotels/borgo-pignano-volterra-tuscany.html" style="border-color:rgba(242,239,230,.4); color:var(--band-ink);">Read my Borgo Pignano review</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container intro-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="deck" style="max-width:44ch;">I&rsquo;ve slept here, not just toured it, and it&rsquo;s the Tuscany estate I&rsquo;d send a family to first.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:20px; max-width:58ch;">Borgo Pignano is a villa and a small stone village on a hilltop outside Volterra, restored and run as one quiet estate. There&rsquo;s no town to walk into and no crowd to work around, just the borgo, its gardens and the hills rolling away in every direction.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:14px; max-width:58ch;">Around nine private villas are spread across the estate, from two to five bedrooms, so families and groups get their own house with the full hotel behind it. The kids get two pools plus their own kids&rsquo; pool and a tennis court, and the adults get a genuinely fantastic gym, a beautiful spa and dinner under the pergola.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:14px; max-width:58ch;">That combination is what makes it work: the privacy of a villa rental, without having to staff it, stock it or cook in it unless you want to.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <dl class="kv">
        {kv.map(([k, v]) => <div class="kv-row"><dt set:html={k} /><dd set:html={v} /></div>)}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="photos reveal">
      <figure><img src="/images/tuscany/borgo-pignano-terrace.jpg" alt="Dinner tables under the reed-roofed pergola at Borgo Pignano, looking out over the hills" width="1280" height="1707" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Dinner under the pergola</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/tuscany/borgo-pignano-aerial.jpg" alt="Aerial view of the Borgo Pignano villa, pool and gardens among the Tuscan hills" width="464" height="660" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>The estate from above</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">Why it works for families</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Your own house, with a hotel behind it</h2>
    <ul class="why reveal">
      <li><b>Two to five bedrooms.</b> The range covers one family, two families or a multigenerational group, and I&rsquo;ll match you to the villa with the right layout and view.</li>
      <li><b>A kids&rsquo; pool.</b> Two pools plus a separate one for kids, and the main pool is the best of the three Tuscan borghi I&rsquo;ve stayed at and visited.</li>
      <li><b>Things to do without leaving.</b> Tennis, a gym and a spa fill the days you don&rsquo;t drive out.</li>
      <li><b>Hotel service.</b> Every amenity is a short walk away, and dinner is taken care of every night if you want it to be.</li>
      <li><b>Quiet.</b> It&rsquo;s quiet enough that the loudest thing at night is the wind in the lavender.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Booking through me</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Fora perks, and someone who knows Borgo Pignano</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="body-2 reveal" style="max-width:62ch;">Borgo Pignano is part of Fora Reserve, so my clients receive Fora perks on eligible stays, like daily breakfast and a hotel credit, and rates are identical to booking direct. I know the property and the team, so I&rsquo;ll match you to the right villa and set everything up before you arrive.</p>
    <dl class="kv reveal" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Getting there</dt><dd>About an hour and a half from Florence. I arrange drivers who know the back roads</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Day trips</dt><dd>Volterra, San Gimignano and <a href="/tuscany.html">the rest of Tuscany</a></dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Comparing estates?</dt><dd><a href="/borgo-san-felice-vs-borgo-pignano.html">Borgo San Felice or Borgo Pignano</a>, <a href="/borgo-pignano-vs-il-borro.html">Borgo Pignano or Il Borro</a>, or <a href="/tuscany-borghi.html">all three side by side</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Before you ask</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The questions I get</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq reveal">
      {faq.map(([q, a]) => (
        <details>
          <summary set:html={q} />
          <p class="body-2" set:html={a} />
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section inquire band on-shadow" id="inquire" style="scroll-margin-top:70px;">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">The Borgo Pignano Villas</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">When are you thinking?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:44ch;">Tell me your dates, who&rsquo;s coming and the kids&rsquo; ages. I&rsquo;ll match you to the right villa and plan the rest of Italy around it.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Borgo Pignano villa inquiry" />
      <input type="hidden" name="hotel" value="Borgo Pignano Villas, Tuscany" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="borgo-pignano-villas-tuscany" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when" style="color:var(--band-ash);">When are you thinking?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="June 2027 · 5 nights · 8 guests" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name" style="color:var(--band-ash);">And where do I send the plan?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
        <label for="q-details" style="margin-top:2px; color:var(--band-ash);">Anything else? Kids&rsquo; ages, occasion, the rest of the trip (optional)</label>
        <input id="q-details" type="text" name="details" placeholder="Kids 7 and 10 · then Florence and Rome" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn" data-gtag-label="villa_inquiry_send" data-gtag-location="villa_cta">Send</button>
      <p class="note" style="color:var(--band-ash);">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .intro-grid { display: grid; gap: 44px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 80px; } }
  .intro-grid > * { min-width: 0; }
  .photos img { aspect-ratio: 4/5; }
  .why { margin-top: 24px; padding-left: 1.1em; max-width: 62ch; }
  .why li { margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .faq details { border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 18px 0; }
  .faq details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .faq summary { cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.2rem; list-style: none; position: relative; padding-right: 28px; }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq summary::after { content: "+"; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; color: var(--brass); font-family: var(--body); }
  .faq details[open] summary::after { content: "\2013"; }
  .faq details p { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 62ch; }
</style>
